Package: scanbus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, sane-utils
Description: scanbus D-Bus service and command-line client
 A session-scoped D-Bus service for document scanners, installed with its
 user-level systemd unit, D-Bus activation file and stable scanimage helper.
